{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29914","headline":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪 · 李损之","name":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雪昼悠扬，飘飞试士场。\n缀毫疑起草，沾字共成章。\n匝地如铺练，凝阶似截肪。\n鹅毛萦树合，柳絮带风狂。\n息疫方殊庆，丰年已报祥。\n应知郢上曲，高唱出东堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李损之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}